        "patternId": "auto-gc-no-grade-three-ride-choice-v1",
        "review": "Exact 27-card GC AUTO wording. Requires the exact source to be placed on GC from hand and the controller's fight-level ride history to explicitly show no Grade 3+ ride. The controller chooses exactly one effect: +10000 to a friendly Vanguard until end of turn, or -2 critical to one opponent unit for this battle."
